 style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">7</span></a> • <a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster%27s_New_Year_Treat#New_Year_Treat_8\" title=\"Taskmaster&#39;s New Year Treat\"><span style=\"color: #FFF;font-family: Veteran Typewriter\">8</span></a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr>\n<tr style=\"font-family: &#39;Veteran Typewriter&#39;\">\n<td align=\"center\">\n<p><span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/The_curse_of_politeness.\" title=\"The curse of politeness.\">The curse of politeness.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Trapped_in_a_loveless_marriage.\" title=\"Trapped in a loveless marriage.\">Trapped in a loveless marriage.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/I_love_to_squander_promise.\" title=\"I love to squander promise.\">I love to squander promise.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/How_heavy_is_the_water%3F\" title=\"How heavy is the water?\">How heavy is the water?</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Old Honkfoot.</strong></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/It%27s_my_milk_now.\" title=\"It&#39;s my milk now.\">It's my milk now.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/Schr%C3%B6dinger%27s_egg.\" title=\"Schrödinger&#39;s egg.\">Schrödinger's egg.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/100%25_Bosco.\" title=\"100% Bosco.\">100% Bosco.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_show_about_pedantry.\" title=\"A show about pedantry.\">A show about pedantry.</a></span> • <span style=\"font-family: Veteran Typewriter;\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_yardstick_for_failure.\" title=\"A yardstick for failure.\">A yardstick for failure.</a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Old Honkfoot.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/27/Old_Honkfoot..png/revision/latest?cb=20230428073742\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Old Honkfoot.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/27/Old_Honkfoot..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230428073742\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/27/Old_Honkfoot..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230428073742 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/27/Old_Honkfoot..png/revision/latest?cb=20230428073742 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Old Honkfoot.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Old_Honkfoot..png\" data-image-name=\"Old Honkfoot..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_15\" title=\"Series 15\">15</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">5</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Mae_Martin\" title=\"Mae Martin\">Mae Martin</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/How_heavy_is_the_water%3F\" title=\"How heavy is the water?\">How heavy is the water?</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/It%27s_my_milk_now.\" title=\"It&#39;s my milk now.\">It's my milk now.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Old Honkfoot.</b></i> is the fifth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_15\" title=\"Series 15\">Series 15</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 27 April 2023. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Mae_Martin\" title=\"Mae Martin\">Mae Martin</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Old_Honkfoot.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> refers to <a href=\"/wiki/Jenny_Eclair\" title=\"Jenny Eclair\">Jenny Eclair</a> as \"Old Honkfoot\", during the <a href=\"/wiki/Play_the_instrument_indicated_by_the_light\" title=\"Play the instrument indicated by the light\">Play the instrument indicated by the light</a> task. The title card contains a guitar's reflection in a spoon, referencing both the <a href=\"/wiki/Play_the_instrument_indicated_by_the_light\" title=\"Play the instrument indicated by the light\">Play the instrument indicated by the light</a> task, and the <a href=\"/wiki/Salvage_the_most_spoons\" title=\"Salvage the most spoons\">Salvage the most spoons</a> task.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Old_Honkfoot.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Gamle Båttefod', which translates as 'Old Honkfoot'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Vanha torvikoipi', which translates as 'Old Honkfoot'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Gamle Tutefoot', which translates as 'Old Tutefoot'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title. <div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Old_Honkfoot.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Frankie_Boyle\" title=\"Frankie Boyle\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Frankie Boyle</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Ivo_Graham\" title=\"Ivo Graham\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Ivo Graham</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jenny_Eclair\" title=\"Jenny Eclair\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jenny Eclair</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Kiell_Smith-Bynoe\" title=\"Kiell Smith-Bynoe\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Kiell Smith-Bynoe</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mae_Martin\" title=\"Mae Martin\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mae Martin</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Luckiest_thing\" title=\"Luckiest thing\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Luckiest thing.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Fake_something\" title=\"Fake something\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Fake something.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Play_the_instrument_indicated_by_the_light\" title=\"Play the instrument indicated by the light\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Play the instrument indicated by the light. Each time you play an instrument correctly, another will be added to the sequence until you make a mistake.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><small><i><b>Bonus:</b> The person who sounds the least worst.</i></small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>1</small>\n</td>\n<td><small>0</small>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Salvage_the_most_spoons\" title=\"Salvage the most spoons\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team:</b> Salvage the most spoons. You may not leave the lab and all spoons must be salvaged with a magnet. Your salvager must not remove their headwear. Also, from now on, you must speak in a very high-pitched voice.\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td rowspan=\"2\"><a href=\"/wiki/Stuff_all_these_things_in_your_teammate%27s_outfit\" title=\"Stuff all these things in your teammate&#39;s outfit\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team Live:</b> Stuff all these things in your teammate's outfit. If you're wearing a special outfit, you must stay on your spot with your hands on your head at all times.\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td>0\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><b>Team Live:</b> Say how many things you stuffed in your teammate's outfit. If you're correct, your points are doubled. If you're wrong, the other team gets your points.\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td>-\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>13\n</td>\n<td>9\n</td>\n<td>22\n</td>\n<td>25\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">28\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Old_Honkfoot.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/old-honkfoot\"><i>Old Honkfoot.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/\"><i>Old Honkfoot.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920141520\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.085 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.177 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 825/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25955/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 174/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.013/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 800520/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%  131.854      1 -total\n 58.83%   77.568      1 Template:Episode_infobox\n 25.86%   34.093      1 Template:Spoilers\n 24.84%   32.755      1 Template:MessageBox\n 12.45%   16.419      1 Template:Episodes\n  8.61%   11.348     10 Template:Link\n  1.20%    1.576      1 Template:Clear\n  1.17%    1.541      1 Template:Chronology\n  1.10%    1.454      5 Template:Color\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_task:pcache:idhash:3627-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260920141520 and revision id 43837. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}}}